TENDL-2021 (TALYS Evaluated Nuclear Data Library)                  425 1451   11
                                                                   425 1451   12
Be009 alpha general purpose library                                425 1451   13
                                                                   425 1451   14
Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                          425 1451   15
                                                                   425 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning, D. Rochman, J.-Ch. Sublet, N. Dzysiuk,          425 1451   17
      M. Fleming, and S. van der Marck, TENDL: Complete nuclear    425 1451   18
      data library for innovative nuclear science and              425 1451   19
